    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d530-a1">

                <pb facs="0537" n="1271" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1271"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 588.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gibson to Mr. Short.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beirut.</hi>
                        </placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1895-08-06T23:59:59+01:56"
                            notBefore="1895-08-04T00:00:00+02:00">undated</date>].
                    </dateline></opener>
                <p>Christie’s house, Tarsus, attacked 4th instant by natives; his students and
                    servants severely beaten; his life threatened. Please secure protection and
                    prosecution.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gibson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
